'''Zombie Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be purchased for 120 [[Cat Food]] in the [[Upgrade Menu]] after completing [[Madagascar (Empire of Cats)|Madagascar]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. It was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]] grants [[Area Attack]], Target [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] and [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], it is obtainable in Hyogo in Chapter 2 and costs 12000 XP. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], Zombie Cat is unlocked in Madagascar in the Empire of Cats chapter and costs 60 Cat Food.

