==Trivia==
*[[Bondage Cat (Special Cat)|Bondage Cat]], [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dom Cat]], [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja Cat]] and Zombie Cat all had their Strong Against ability removed in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] and readded in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.7 Update|Version 2.0.7]].
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Skelecat was a part of another [[Cat Combo]] called [[Five Hearts (Removed Combo)|Five Hearts]].
*[[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]] granted Zombie Cat the [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] Target and [[Zombie Killer]].
*In the Switch Version, Zombie Cat's True Form is a playable form, however, it can only be accessed through save file editing.
**When modified to be added in, it shows that it did not receive Zombie targeting nor Zombie Killer ability when [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]] was added into the game.
